 osteoarthritis &#x02013; a pharmacological evaluation</article-title><source>J Rheumatol</source><year>1987</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>130</fpage><lpage>131</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3625668</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bove</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name><name><surname>Calcaterra</surname><given-names>SL</given-names></name><name><surname>Brooker</surname><given-names>RM</given-names></name><name><surname>Huber</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name><name><surname>Guzman</surname><given-names>RE</given-names></name><name><surname>Juneau</surname><given-names>PL</given-names></name><name><surname>Schrier</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Kilgore</surname><given-names>KS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Weight bearing as a measure of disease progression and efficacy of anti-inflammatory compounds in a model of monosodium iodoacetate-induced osteoarthritis</article-title><source>Osteoarthritis Cartilage</source><year>2003</year><volume>11</volume><fpage>821</fpage><lpage>830</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14609535</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S1063-4584(03)00163-8</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Combe</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Bramwell</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Field</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The monosodium iodoacetate model of osteoarthritis: a model of chronic nociceptive pain in rats?</article-title><source>Neurosci Lett</source><year>2004</year><volume>370</volume><fpage>236</fpage><lpage>240</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15488329</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.neulet.2004.08.023</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal">